# Private material: kept locally, never pushed
archive/

# Lecture notes: sources and the notes PDF stay private until the end of the
# course; only the weekly exercise sheets (without solutions) and the background
# appendix notes/background.pdf are published. The combined sheet
# notes/exercises.pdf is built locally for cross-references only.
# To release the notes, add: !notes/lecture_notes.pdf
notes/*
!notes/exercises_week[1-5].pdf
!notes/background.pdf

